  "@note": "Traditional Chinese (Taiwan) translation of l10n/store/en.json: the Play listing, Play Games texts and the 42 achievements. Achievement names 1-24 are built from the ARB passport words (stamp_*_name · passportMedal_*), descriptions 1-24 from stamp_*_goal*, so the game and Play Console agree.",
